      "urn": "urn:cts:copticLit:nt.mark.bohairic_ed:4",
      "dialect": "bohairic"
    },
    {
      "coptic": "ⲙⲁⲣⲉⲗⲁⲁⲩ ϭⲱ ⲉϥⲛⲕⲟⲧⲕ ⲉⲣϣⲁⲛⲧⲉⲩϣⲏ ⲟⲩⲉⲓⲛⲉ ⲛϥ**ϣⲁ** ⲛϭⲓⲡⲣⲏ ·",
      "english": "No man remaineth asleep when once the night hath passed away, and the Sun hath risen.",
